 "files": [
  {
   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Product Callouts\n\nA product in the centre with three or four thin leader lines drawing out from points on it to labels with short spec text, one after another, in a spec-sheet style. The product is a drawn tumbler or your own image; labels, specs and the points the lines start from come from one variable.\n\nCategory: commerce. Length: 6 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- Showing what a product is made of: material, size, weight, features.\n- A product with several small selling points that each need a pointer.\n\nAvoid when:\n- Selling points that are not about a part of the product: use step-explainer or stat-trio.\n- More than four points: the labels crowd.\n\nVariables:\n- title (string): Title, default \"Tumbler Kopi Senja\"\n- subtitle (string): Subtitle, default \"Spesifikasi\"\n- callouts (string): Callouts, default \"Tutup|Anti bocor|68|6\\nBahan|Stainless 304|30|30\\nKapasitas|500 ml|70|55\\nBerat|280 g|34|80\"\n- image (string): Image, default \"\"\n- bg_color (color): Background, default \"#ffffff\"\n- main_color (color): Main colour, default \"#2563eb\"\n- text_color (color): Text colour, default \"#0a0a0a\"\n- muted_color (color): Muted colour, default \"#737373\"\n- body_color (color): Product tone, default \"#ececec\"\n- font_family (string): Font, default \"Geist\"\n- transparent (boolean): Transparent, default false\n\nSource: Mosio original. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
  {
   "path": "scene.html",
   "role": "source",
   "content": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Product Callouts\n\n  A product in the centre with three or four thin leader lines drawing out from points on it to labels with short spec text, one after another, in a spec-sheet style. The product is a drawn tumbler or your own image; labels, specs and the points the lines start from come from one variable.\n\n  An original usemosio/blocks block (MIT, see LICENSE).\n-->\n<html\n  lang=\"en\"\n  data-composition-id=\"product-callouts\"\n  data-composition-duration=\"6\"\n  data-composition-variables='[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"title\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Title\",\n    \"description\": \"Product name above the product.\",\n    \"default\": \"Tumbler Kopi Senja\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"subtitle\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Subtitle\",\n    \"description\": \"One short line under the title.\",\n    \"default\": \"Spesifikasi\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"callouts\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Callouts\",\n    \"description\": \"One per line, up to 4: Label|Spec|x|y. x and y (0 to 100) are where the line starts on the product box. Points left of the middle get their label on the left.\",\n    \"default\": \"Tutup|Anti bocor|68|6\\nBahan|Stainless 304|30|30\\nKapasitas|500 ml|70|55\\nBerat|280 g|34|80\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"image\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Image\",\n    \"description\": \"Optional product image URL (a transparent PNG works best). Empty draws a tumbler.\",\n    \"default\": \"\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"bg_color\",\n    \"type\": \"color\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Background\",\n    \"description\": \"Background.\",\n    \"default\": \"#ffffff\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"main_color\",\n    \"type\": \"color\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Main colour\",\n    \"description\": \"Dots at the points: the one accent.\",\n    \"default\": \"#2563eb\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"text_color\",\n    \"type\": \"color\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Text colour\",\n    \"description\": \"Title, specs, lines and the drawn product outline.\",\n    \"default\": \"#0a0a0a\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"muted_color\",\n    \"type\": \"color\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Muted colour\",\n    \"description\": \"Labels and subtitle.\",\n    \"default\": \"#737373\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"body_color\",\n    \"type\": \"color\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Product tone\",\n    \"description\": \"Fill of the drawn product.\",\n    \"default\": \"#ececec\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"font_family\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Font\",\n    \"description\": \"Google Fonts family name; Geist is loaded, others only if the host loads them.\",\n    \"default\": \"Geist\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"transparent\",\n    \"type\": \"boolean\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Transparent\",\n    \"description\": \"Leave the background clear so the block sits over your own scene.\",\n    \"default\": false\n  }\n]'\n>\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <title>Product Callouts</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <template>\n      <link\n        rel=\"stylesheet\"\n        href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;display=block\"\n      />\n      <style>\n        #root {\n          position: absolute; inset: 0; overflow: hidden; container-type: size; pointer-events: none;\n          -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n          background: var(--pco-bg); color: var(--pco-text); font-family: var(--pco-font);\n        }\n        #root * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n        .pco-stage { position: absolute; inset: 0; --u: calc(100cqmin / 1080); }\n\n        .pco-svg { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: visible; }\n        .pco-prod { position: absolute; background-size: contain; background-position: center; background-repeat: no-repeat; }\n        .pco-prod svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }\n        .pco-title { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; text-align: center; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.04em; white-space: nowrap; }\n        .pco-sub { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; text-align: center; font-weight: 500; color: var(--pco-muted); white-space: nowrap; }\n        .pco-lab { position: absolute; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: calc(var(--u) * 2); }\n        .pco-lab b { font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--pco-muted); white-space: nowrap; }\n        .pco-lab span { font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }\n\n      </style>\n\n      <div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"product-callouts\" data-duration=\"6\" data-fps=\"30\">\n        <div id=\"pco-clip\" class=\"pco-stage clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"6\" data-track-index=\"0\">\n          <div class=\"pco-prod\" id=\"pco-prod\"></div>\n          <svg class=\"pco-svg\" id=\"pco-svg\"></svg>\n          <div class=\"pco-title\" id=\"pco-title\"></div><div class=\"pco-sub\" id=\"pco-sub\"></div>\n          <div id=\"pco-labs\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n        <script>\n          (function () {\n            \"use strict\";\n            var root = document.getElementById(\"root\");\n            var vars = window.__hyperframes && window.__hyperframes.getVariables ? window.__hyperframes.getVariables() || {} : {};\n            function num(v, d, a, b) { var n = Number(v); return Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.min(b, Math.max(a, n)) : d; }\n            function str(v, d) { return typeof v === \"string\" && v.trim() ? v : d; }\n            function colr(v, d) { return typeof v === \"string\" && v.trim() && window.CSS && CSS.supports(\"color\", v.trim()) ? v.trim() : d; }\n            function bool(v, d) { return v === true || v === \"true\" ? true : v === false || v === \"false\" ? false : d; }\n            function el(tag, cls, parent, html) { var e = document.createElement(tag); if (cls) e.className = cls; if (html !== undefined) e.innerHTML = html; if (parent) parent.appendChild(e); return e; }\n            function esc(s) { return String(s).replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\").replace(/</g, \"&lt;\"); }\n            function lines(v, d) { var s = typeof v === \"string\" && v.trim() ? v : d; return s.split(/\\r?\\n/).map(function (l) { return l.trim(); }).filter(Boolean); }\n            function dots(n) { return String(Math.round(n)).replace(/\\B(?=(\\d{3})+(?!\\d))/g, \".\"); }\n            function ease(n, a, b) { return Math.min(1, Math.max(0, (n - a) / (b - a))); }\n            var W = root.clientWidth || 1080, H = root.clientHeight || 1920, U = Math.min(W, H) / 1080, PORTRAIT = H > W;\n            var PAL = [[\"bg\", \"bg_color\", \"#ffffff\"], [\"main\", \"main_color\", \"#2563eb\"], [\"text\", \"text_color\", \"#0a0a0a\"], [\"muted\", \"muted_color\", \"#737373\"], [\"body\", \"body_color\", \"#ececec\"]];\n            PAL.forEach(function (c) { root.style.setProperty(\"--pco-\" + c[0], colr(vars[c[1]], c[2])); });\n            root.style.setProperty(\"--pco-font\", '\"' + str(vars.font_family, \"Geist\") + '\", Geist, system-ui, sans-serif');\n            if (bool(vars.transparent, false)) root.style.background = \"transparent\";\n\n\n            var NS = \"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\";\n            var titleEl = document.getElementById(\"pco-title\"), subEl = document.getElementById(\"pco-sub\");\n            titleEl.textContent = str(vars.title, \"Tumbler Kopi Senja\"); subEl.textContent = typeof vars.subtitle === \"string\" ? vars.subtitle : \"Spesifikasi\";\n            var ty = PORTRAIT ? 150 : 56;\n            titleEl.style.top = ty * U + \"px\"; titleEl.style.fontSize = (PORTRAIT ? 76 : 64) * U + \"px\";\n            subEl.style.top = (ty + (PORTRAIT ? 92 : 72)) * U + \"px\"; subEl.style.fontSize = (PORTRAIT ? 38 : 32) * U + \"px\";\n            var pw = (PORTRAIT ? 440 : 330) * U, ph = (PORTRAIT ? 980 : 740) * U;\n            var px0 = W / 2 - pw / 2, py0 = H * (PORTRAIT ? 0.56 : 0.58) - ph / 2;\n            var prod = document.getElementById(\"pco-prod\");\n            prod.style.left = px0 + \"px\"; prod.style.top = py0 + \"px\"; prod.style.width = pw + \"px\"; prod.style.height = ph + \"px\";\n            var img = str(vars.image, \"\");\n            if (img) prod.style.backgroundImage = 'url(\"' + img.replace(/\"/g, \"\") + '\")';\n            else prod.innerHTML = '<svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 720\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\"><rect x=\"64\" y=\"14\" width=\"212\" height=\"64\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"var(--pco-text)\"/><path d=\"M46 84 L294 84 L264 690 Q262 708 244 708 L96 708 Q78 708 76 690 Z\" fill=\"var(--pco-body)\" stroke=\"var(--pco-text)\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"300\" width=\"220\" height=\"150\" fill=\"var(--pco-text)\" opacity=\".9\"/><rect x=\"96\" y=\"346\" width=\"120\" height=\"14\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"var(--pco-bg)\"/><rect x=\"96\" y=\"378\" width=\"80\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"var(--pco-bg)\" opacity=\".6\"/></svg>';\n            var svg = document.getElementById(\"pco-svg\"); svg.setAttribute(\"viewBox\", \"0 0 \" + W + \" \" + H);\n            var labsBox = document.getElementById(\"pco-labs\");\n            var items = lines(vars.callouts, \"\").slice(0, 4).map(function (l) {\n              var a = l.split(\"|\"); return { label: (a[0] || \"\").trim(), spec: (a[1] || \"\").trim(), x: num(a[2], 50, 0, 100), y: num(a[3], 50, 0, 100) };\n            });\n            var gap = 36 * U, colW = Math.min(300 * U, (W / 2 - pw / 2 - gap - 50 * U));\n            var sides = { left: [], right: [] };\n            items.forEach(function (it) { it.px = px0 + pw * it.x / 100; it.py = py0 + ph * it.y / 100; (it.x < 50 ? sides.left : sides.right).push(it); });\n            [\"left\", \"right\"].forEach(function (sd) {\n              var arr = sides[sd].sort(function (a, b) { return a.py - b.py; }), minGap = (PORTRAIT ? 150 : 140) * U, prev = -1e9;\n              arr.forEach(function (it) { it.ly = Math.max(it.py, prev + minGap); prev = it.ly; it.side = sd; });\n              var over = arr.length ? arr[arr.length - 1].ly - (py0 + ph) : 0;\n              if (over > 0) arr.forEach(function (it) { it.ly -= over; });\n            });\n            var tl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true });\n            tl.fromTo(\"#pco-prod\", { opacity: 0, y: 30 * U }, { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 0.7, ease: \"power3.out\" }, 0.1);\n            tl.fromTo(\"#pco-title\", { opacity: 0, y: -20 * U }, { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 0.5, ease: \"power3.out\" }, 0.2);\n            tl.fromTo(\"#pco-sub\", { opacity: 0 }, { opacity: 1, duration: 0.5, ease: \"power2.out\" }, 0.4);\n            items.forEach(function (it, i) {\n              var L = it.side === \"left\", ex = L ? px0 - gap : px0 + pw + gap, ox = L ? ex - colW : ex + colW;\n              var path = document.createElementNS(NS, \"path\");\n              path.setAttribute(\"d\", \"M\" + it.px + \" \" + it.py + \" L\" + ex + \" \" + it.ly + \" L\" + ox + \" \" + it.ly);\n              path.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"none\"); path.setAttribute(\"stroke\", \"var(--pco-text)\"); path.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", 2 * U);\n              path.setAttribute(\"stroke-linejoin\", \"round\"); path.setAttribute(\"pathLength\", \"1\"); path.setAttribute(\"stroke-dasharray\", \"1\"); path.setAttribute(\"stroke-dashoffset\", \"1\");\n              svg.appendChild(path);\n              var g = document.createElementNS(NS, \"g\"); g.setAttribute(\"transform\", \"translate(\" + it.px + \" \" + it.py + \")\"); svg.appendChild(g);\n              var ring = document.createElementNS(NS, \"circle\"); ring.setAttribute(\"r\", 17 * U);\n              ring.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"none\"); ring.setAttribute(\"stroke\", \"var(--pco-main)\"); ring.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", 2 * U); g.appendChild(ring);\n              var dot = document.createElementNS(NS, \"circle\"); dot.setAttribute(\"r\", 7.5 * U);\n              dot.setAttribute(\"fill\", \"var(--pco-main)\"); g.appendChild(dot);\n              var lab = el(\"div\", \"pco-lab\", labsBox, \"<b>\" + esc(it.label) + \"</b><span>\" + esc(it.spec) + \"</span>\");\n              lab.querySelector(\"b\").style.fontSize = 26 * U + \"px\"; lab.querySelector(\"span\").style.fontSize = (PORTRAIT ? 32 : 44) * U + \"px\";\n              lab.style.width = colW + \"px\"; lab.style.left = (L ? ox : ex) + \"px\"; lab.style.textAlign = L ? \"right\" : \"left\";\n              lab.style.bottom = (H - it.ly + 14 * U) + \"px\";\n              var t0 = 0.9 + i * 0.55;\n              tl.fromTo(dot, { scale: 0 }, { scale: 1, duration: 0.3, ease: \"back.out(1.6)\" }, t0);\n              tl.fromTo(ring, { scale: 0, opacity: 0 }, { scale: 1, opacity: 1, duration: 0.4, ease: \"power3.out\" }, t0 + 0.05);\n              tl.to(path, { strokeDashoffset: 0, duration: 0.55, ease: \"power2.inOut\" }, t0 + 0.2);\n              tl.fromTo(lab, { opacity: 0, x: (L ? -1 : 1) * 24 * U }, { opacity: 1, x: 0, duration: 0.45, ease: \"power3.out\" }, t0 + 0.5);\n            });\n\n            var total = parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"6\");\n            if (tl.duration() < total) tl.to({}, { duration: total - tl.duration() });\n            tl.seek(0);\n            window.__timelines = window.__timelines || {};\n            window.__timelines[\"product-callouts\"] = tl;\n          })();\n        </script>\n      </div>\n    </template>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"
  }
 ],
